      "message": "tests: Add synchronization and callback fixtures.\n\nwindows-sync-conformance.c checks observable synchronization semantics\n(event exchange, wait-all, pulses, abandoned mutexes, APCs, 32,768 live\nevents); windows-sync-stress.c covers contended and cross-process cases.\nmessage-stress.c drives window-message callbacks with large payloads for\nthe ARM64 callback stack-bounds check. The two synchronization fixtures\ncarry their own MIT headers.",
