      },
      "message": "winemac: Promote only activatable windows to a Dock application.\n\nPreviously ordering in any Cocoa window made the process a regular\napplication, so explorer.exe /desktop and helper processes each added a\nDock icon next to the game's. Promote only for a window the user can\nactivate: WS_EX_NOACTIVATE windows and tool windows (WS_EX_TOOLWINDOW\nwithout WS_EX_APPWINDOW) no longer do, in both the order-in and the focus\npath. Explorer's stand-alone systray window becomes a tool window, as the\nreal taskbar is.",
