        "date": "2026-10-09T06:05:47Z"
      },
      "message": "faudio: Keep the sample timeline current when resampling is bypassed.\n\nAt a 1:1 rate the resampler is skipped and the voice's sample offset was\nleft behind; a later playback-rate change then resumed from a stale\noffset and the voice hung. Write the offset as totalSamples * FIXED_ONE\nso it cannot drift from the decoded count on a short decode.",
      "tree": {
