      },
      "message": "ntdll: Optionally resolve the Steam client DLL to a builtin lsteamclient.\n\nWith STRATUM_NATIVE_STEAM=1, loading steamclient.dll or steamclient64.dll,\nby plain name or absolute path, resolves to lsteamclient.dll through the\nnormal builtin loader. Nothing in third-party code is modified and no\nbinary-specific offsets are involved. Off by default.",
